                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUR MESSVERWALTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉ DE GESTION DE MESURE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR MEASUREMENT MANAGEMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system for measurement management is configured to obtain a configuration set and an associated configuration unique identifier (UID). The system is also configured to obtain at least one measurement result and an associated result UID. A relation between the configuration UID and the result UID is determined, and the relation is stored.</p>
